		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère $A(x)=({{if:s1>0|x{{eval:-(p);+}}|{{p}}-x}})({{if:s2>0|x{{eval:-(q);+}}|{{q}}-x}})$.\n\nPour $x\\in\\left]{{p}}\\,;{{q}}\\right[$, $A(x)$ est :\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- strictement positif\n- strictement négatif\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "-6..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "eval:(p)+(k)"
