			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour $x\\in\\left]{{p}}\\,;{{q}}\\right[$ : ${{if:s1>0|x{{eval:-(p);+}}|{{p}}-x}}$ est {{if:u>0|positif|négatif}} et ${{if:s2>0|x{{eval:-(q);+}}|{{q}}-x}}$ est {{if:w>0|positif|négatif}}.",
					"Par la **règle des signes** du produit, $A(x)$ est \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\text{strictement {{if:v>0|positif|négatif}}}}."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "On considère $A(x)=({{if:s1>0|x{{eval:-(p);+}}|{{p}}-x}})({{if:s2>0|x{{eval:-(q);+}}|{{q}}-x}})$.\n\nPour $x\\in{{if:g==0|\\left]-\\infty\\,;{{p}}\\right[|\\left]{{q}}\\,;+\\infty\\right[}}$, $A(x)$ est :\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- strictement positif\n- strictement négatif\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "g",
					"expression": "0|1"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "-6..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "eval:(p)+(k)"
				},
				{
					"name": "s1",
					"expression": "-1|1"
				},
				{
					"name": "s2",
					"expression": "-1|1"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "eval:((p)-1)*(1-(g))+((q)+1)*(g)"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "eval:(s1)*((t)-(p))"
				},
				{
					"name": "w",
					"expression": "eval:(s2)*((t)-(q))"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "eval:(u)*(w)"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{if:v>0|0|1}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"Pour $x\\in{{if:g==0|\\left]-\\infty\\,;{{p}}\\right[|\\left]{{q}}\\,;+\\infty\\right[}}$ : ${{if:s1>0|x{{eval:-(p);+}}|{{p}}-x}}$ est {{if:u>0|positif|négatif}} et ${{if:s2>0|x{{eval:-(q);+}}|{{q}}-x}}$ est {{if:w>0|positif|négatif}}.",
					"Par la **règle des signes** du produit, $A(x)$ est \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\text{strictement {{if:v>0|positif|négatif}}}}."
				]
			}
		}
	],
